<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0678_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ernest</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You got some NERVE!\nThat’s hard!\fJust what I look for in a homie!\rWhadda ya say we swap numbers and be\nBEST homies? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">AIGHT!\nCall me anytime!\rAbout school, homies, a puzzle,\na Block trick, your feelings...\fEven if nothin’ come up, call!\rI prob’ly won’t know the answer, but\nI’ll LISTEN! ’Cause we homies!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo! What, you nervous?\nIt’s the tattoos. They temporary.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh, I see you finally figured out\nhow amazin’ I’m?\rWell, that’s expected. Let’s\nswap numbers! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I prob’ly look WAY scarier than I’m.\nWould you believe I’m a nice guy?\rI won’t bite, so come talk to me in\nperson! I brought cookies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yo, Teddy! You do a pretty good\nmotorcycle impression!\rNext time you and me should go ridin’\nand yell like motorcycles.\fVROOOOM!\r......Wait, who is this?\rOh no! Wrong number!\nForget you heard that!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My {STRVAR_1 0, 10, 0} go HARD!\nIts fightin’ spirit is DIFFERENT.\rIt never lost to nothin’ but the\nstrongest homies!\rWhat about your homies? Fightin’ spirit?\rNever mind, you ain’t gotta answer.\nI KNOW how strong your homies is.\fI still have nightmares.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">We a Biker gang, you know.\nGot homies with poison, spikes,\ffangs, even Ghost types.\fAll a show of how TOUGH we.\rBut...\rAs for me...\rI REALLY like cute homies like MARILL!\nI got a MARILL keychain. On my bike.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">So yesterday I was finna catch a\n{STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0}.\fBut that {STRVAR_1 0, 11, 0} took one look at me\fand DIPPED!\rIt was SO rude! I was smilin’!\rYou wouldn’t run if you saw me,\nwould you...? Be honest. Don’t.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">YO! I REALLY wanna scrap you again!\nI’m itchin’ to show off!\rI’m always hangin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}.\nDon’t get nervous and dip, got it?!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">What’s goin’ on with you?\nI’m waitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!\rYou wouldn’t forget a promise you made\nwith a homie, would you?\fI’d cry. Biker tears. Manly ones.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0678_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You know, my bro Markey was talkin’\nabout this... You thought about\fjoinin’ our crew?\rWe hang on Cycling Road and make a LOT\nof noise, throw trash around,\fthen pick up our trash and take it\fhome to recycle.\fWe also do yoga Tuesdays.</language>
	</row>
</body>
